      "id": "D1",
      "reason": "The re-enrollment flag in the Verify response is recomputed from the handle version in the caller-writable request buffer when the response is built. The private value derived earlier is no longer the only source. If the buffer changes after verification, the reported flag changes too.",
      "witness_test_ids": [
        "T02"
      ]
    },
